    {
      "title": "r/SillyTavernAI on Reddit: New RP Mistral 24B merge: sophosymp...",
      "url": "https://www.reddit.com/r/SillyTavernAI/comments/1ri3713/new_rp_mistral_24b_merge/",
      "snippet": "This lets me gauge how well the model does with course-correcting bad habits as well as gives an indication of how dumb it becomes when the context gets too big. Magistry took some fairly heavy subject matter involving a gyaru high school girl and wrote accurate and believable internal thoughts for her as she went to lunch. At this point in the chat I had been seeing other 24b Mistral finetunes repeating stuff, structuring sentences the same way, responding with questions (to get the user to do the heavy lifting), and getting details totally wrong."
    },
    {
      "title": "MS3-RP-Broth-24B",
      "url": "https://www.promptlayer.com/models/ms3-rp-broth-24b",
      "snippet": "The model's uniqueness lies in its complex merging architecture that combines multiple specialized models with carefully calibrated weights and parameters, specifically optimized for roleplaying applications. This model is primarily designed for roleplaying scenarios and works best with specific sampling presets (Weird preset and Forgotten-Safeword preset) and the Mistral-V7-Tekken prompt format."
    }
